 "rule": [
  "Each schema transcribes the reference's schema of the same name to the checker's keyword set. String literals become enums; optional members stay optional.",
  "SessionConfig keeps model, instructions, audio, delegation and store. AudioConfig keeps the PCM format and output.voice as a string. delegation keeps its ClientDelegation branch and null.",
  "SessionResource keeps id, expires_at, model, status, audio, delegation, instructions, input as an untyped array, and store.",
  "Server events keep every documented member. The checker closes every object."
 ],
 "omitted": [
  "Client events the duplex engine does not send: session.update, session.input_audio.mute and unmute, session.instructions.append, session.thinking.append, session.commentary.append, response.item.create, response.create.",
  "Server events a client-delegation primary WebSocket session does not request: session.updated, the input_audio muted and unmuted acknowledgments, the append acknowledgments, response.event, the reflected sideband session.input_audio.append, and the SIP transport and DTMF events.",
  "AudioPCMU, AudioPCMA, CustomVoice, the Responses delegation branch, ClientConfig, and InitialItem member shapes."
 ],
